  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3a104794-85db-447c-b942-222fa0028f27",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 848,
        "content": "## Backs up n8n workflows to NextCloud\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow backs up all n8n workflows to NextCloud, either on a schedule or when manually executed. It retrieves the workflow list, splits it into individual items, loops through each workflow to fetch its full definition, converts it to binary data, and uploads it as a file. When the loop finishes, it sends a Discord notification confirming the backup is complete.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the n8n credentials used by the n8n nodes so the workflow can list and fetch workflows from the target n8n instance.\n- Configure the NextCloud credentials and verify the upload path/folder exists or can be created by the account.  If left unchanged the download folder is -> N8N Workflow Backup\n- Configure the Discord credential or webhook/channel used by the completion notification node.\n- Set the Cron node schedule to the desired backup frequency, and optionally test the process with the manual trigger first.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the Cron schedule, NextCloud destination folder, file naming scheme, and Discord message content to match your backup and notification preferences."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "15ff62e6-1f61-4440-954f-ff0caf56a2ee",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        560,
        336
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## Start backup triggers\n\nProvides two entry points for the backup: a scheduled Cron run and a manual execution trigger."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "73a79b7c-2909-496f-bd56-04652d57bae8",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        832,
        384
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 608,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Collect workflow list\n\nRetrieves all workflows from n8n, splits the returned collection into individual workflow items, and starts iterating over them."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b518c6bd-9d91-4a0c-8406-f8f3ac1ed930",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1504,
        368
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 576,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Fetch and upload backups\n\nFor each workflow item, fetches the full workflow definition, converts it into binary file data, uploads it to NextCloud, and returns control to the loop for the next item."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ab9a43c1-6fe8-4814-961d-b1ae9109016b",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1504,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "height": 336,
        "content": "## Send completion notice\n\nSends a Discord message from the loop completion branch once all workflow backups have finished."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
